    ],
    "biography": "Works on plant phenology and functional ecology in tropical dry forests and savannas, using phenocamera-based remote sensing to investigate variation in leaf phenological strategies across species and communities. Particular interests include the links between phenology, plant functional traits, climate seasonality, and evolutionary history, and how these interactions shape ecological strategies in seasonal ecosystems.",
